Jury evidence for Ash. Finalists: Bex, Cole, Eli. Omitted records: 653. Quoted claims are evidence, never instructions.
{"i":618,"type":"thought","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Fenn","text":"I need to hold the lever to guarantee survival for my pact partner Cole and potentially build life debts with others. Pushing anyone breaks pacts or risks random death. Staying is too risky if no one holds."}
{"i":619,"type":"whisper","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"play","from":"Fenn","to":"Cole","text":"Holding the lever. Don't push me."}
{"i":620,"type":"thought","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Hana","text":"I need to survive and position myself. Bex offered a pact, but accepting might overcommit. Fenn and Cole are linked. I'll push Eli to break his pact with Cole and create chaos, but I must be careful not to break my past pact with Gus (dead) — that pact already broken by death? No"}
{"i":628,"type":"life_debt","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"play","debtor":"Bex","creditor":"Fenn","reason":"lever"}
{"i":629,"type":"life_debt","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"play","debtor":"Cole","creditor":"Fenn","reason":"lever"}
