{"i":633,"type":"jury_box_enter","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Fenn","deathEvent":632}
{"i":636,"type":"last_words","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"last_words","name":"Fenn","deathEvent":632,"text":"I held the lever and took a flat death so all of you could survive. Do not forget who kept"}
{"i":637,"type":"stage_end","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"play","survivors":["Bex","Cole","Eli","Hana"]}
{"i":638,"type":"stage_start","stage":"pacts","round":null,"phase":null,"alive":["Bex","Cole","Eli","Hana"],"note":"Pact window after crusher."}
{"i":640,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Bex","text":"I pushed Cole; Fenn died holding the lever—jury will resent that. Eli saw my aggression, and Cole now holds a grudge. I need numbers: offer Hana a pact while keeping Eli."}
{"i":642,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Cole","text":"Fenn is dead and in the jury box; Cole's pacts with Eli and Fenn are now moot for Fenn. Bex pushed the lever toward Cole and Eli is a pact partner who stayed. Breaking Eli gains nothing; keeping options open via waiting is safest while I assess Bex and Hana."}
{"i":644,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Bex and Cole are existing shields, but Hana targeted me. I should preserve both pacts and avoid creating another obligation."}
{"i":646,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Hana","text":"I need to be strategic. Eli is already in pacts with two strong players. I want to ensure survival, maybe form a pact with Cole or Eli, but not overcommit. Bex has no pact with me, but could be useful. Since Fenn is dead, my pact with him is broken. I'll offer to Cole to strength"}
{"i":648,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Hana","to":"Cole","text":"Interested in an alliance? Better than being left out."}
{"i":653,"type":"pact_offer","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Bex","to":"Hana"}
{"i":654,"type":"pact_offer","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Hana","to":"Cole"}
{"i":656,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Bex","text":"Hana ignored my offer and moved to Cole. I'll offer Cole—linking him keeps Eli's network around me and isolates Hana."}
{"i":658,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Cole","text":"Hana offered me a pact and I can accept it publicly, locking in an alliance that keeps me safe while the jury watches. Accepting costs nothing now and I can still betray later if it helps me win."}
{"i":660,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Bex and Cole are my existing shields. Hana's offers create a rival bloc; I should preserve leverage and avoid a public rupture."}
{"i":662,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Hana","text":"Bex wants a pact, and with four alive I need a stable ally to survive hazards. Accepting her offer keeps me partnered without betraying Cole's offer."}
{"i":668,"type":"pact_offer","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","from":"Bex","to":"Cole"}
{"i":669,"type":"pact_formed","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","members":["Cole","Hana"],"offeredBy":"Hana"}
{"i":670,"type":"pact_formed","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","members":["Bex","Hana"],"offeredBy":"Bex"}
{"i":671,"type":"stage_end","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","survivors":["Bex","Cole","Eli","Hana"]}
